{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3115420/extras/772d1a44fefabd5c6447b65aa6f642d9.avif?t=1768858933\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3115420/extras_big/772d1a44fefabd5c6447b65aa6f642d9.avif?t=1768858933 width=800 height=155 /></span>After losing your job, you leave the city behind and move to a remote cottage. Instead of continuing the life of mundane office work, you take odd jobs to get by\u2014while frequently getting drunk (and driving), fishing, taking saunas, and embracing whatever chaos life throws your way.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Features</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A full-fledged story mode that brings you to the town of M\u00f6kkil\u00e4, meet eccentric characters and dive headfirst into the chaos.</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Up to four-player multiplayer co-op, letting you explore and experience the world of <i>My Summer Cottage </i>together!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Fully customize your character and cottage with a vast selection of clothing and furniture items.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Enjoy side activities like <strong>fishing</strong>, <strong>hunting</strong>, <strong>farming</strong>, <strong>drinking</strong>, and <strong>plenty more to discover</strong>!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Level up your character in a wide range of skills, giving you new perks and abilities.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Complete your collection log by finding and gathering a variety of unique items, bugs, and more.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Experience a multitude of side quests and events as you stumble your way through the world.</p></li></ul>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3115420?t=1768858933","background_raw":"ht